(## 6 Design path \(R1-R4\)) Tj T*
(R1 baseline: ED 400.29 pass; 4C plating fail \(anode min -0.4385 V\).) Tj T*
(R2 architecture levers \(thin CC/separator, fast-charge kit, N/P up, combo\):) Tj T*
(ED up to 566.3, plating persists - diagnosed: anode-potential minimum occurs at the) Tj T*
(END of the 4C charge \(V=4.2 cut-off\), anode-side polarization dominates.) Tj T*
(R3 electrolyte transport kit \(t+ 0.6, D_e 1e-9, kappa 2.0, negative radius 4 um\):) Tj T*
(plating eliminated \(anode min +0.0420 V\) but plating-free charge now accepts more) Tj T*
(current: 4C T_max 335.77 K overshoot.) Tj T*
(R4 cooling h=100 + transport margin \(t+ 0.7, D_e 2e-9, kappa 3.0, radius 3 um\):) Tj T*
(all criteria pass. Cooling-kinetics trade-off: h=150 \(R4-V4-coolmax\) re-plates the) Tj T*
(cell \(anode min -0.0006 V - cooler cell slows kinetics\).) Tj T*
(Backup R4-V1-cool also passes all criteria \(ED 499.43, anode min +0.0247 V,) Tj T*
(4C T_max 325.08 K\).) Tj T*
